  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Bidding**: Players bid to accept the turned-up trump or name a new suit/game (Betli, Klopitzky). 2. **Melding**: Before the first trick, players announce 'sequences' and 'Vannak' (four of a kind). 3. **The Play**: Declarer competes against the two opponents (who cooperate). 4. **Figures**: During play, players may announce 'Ultimo' (winning last trick with trump 7) or 'Volat' (winning all tricks).",
    Player: "1. **Bidding**: Players bid to accept the turned-up trump or name a new suit/game (Betli, Klopitzky). 2. **Melding**: Before the first trick, players announce 'sequences' and 'Vannak' (four of a kind). 3. **The Play**: Declarer competes against the two opponents (who cooperate). 4. **Figures**: During play, players may announce 'Ultimo' (winning last trick with trump 7) or 'Volat' (winning all tricks).",
    objective: "As declarer, score more points through tricks, melds, and 'figures' than the highest-scoring opponent.",
    gameplay: "1. **Bidding**: Players bid to accept the turned-up trump or name a new suit/game (Betli, Klopitzky). 2. **Melding**: Before the first trick, players announce 'sequences' and 'Vannak' (four of a kind). 3. **The Play**: Declarer competes against the two opponents (who cooperate). 4. **Figures**: During play, players may announce 'Ultimo' (winning last trick with trump 7) or 'Volat' (winning all tricks).",
    keyRules: [
      'Trump Rank: Under (Alsos) highest, then 9, A, 10, K, Over, 8, 7.',
      'No-Trump Rank: A, 10, K, Over, Under, 9, 8, 7.',
      "Kontra: Opponents can double the score if they feel the declarer will lose. Declarer can 'Rekontra' to quadruple.",
      'Last Trick: Worth 10 bonus points.',
